Title:  The Wreckers Against The Builders

Seq:    12.6.169.2.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Vonnegut, Kurt|Kurt Vonnegut]], 2008, from the story "[[The Unicorn Trap]]"

Timestamp: 20260421204315

Date Added: 2026-04-21 14:43:15 -0600

Date Modified: 2026-10-15 12:27:06 -0600

Referenced In: We make things for one another

Body:

"The wreckers against the builders!" said Elmer. "There's the whole story of life!"

"I am not going to help the wreckers," said Elmer. "My son and I are builders."
